  "abstract": "After a series of failed high-risk experiments, this submission returns to a parsimonious, methodical approach. It aims to improve the SOTA Fourier Forecaster baseline by changing a single hyperparameter. Based on peer experiments (Ariadne I, Aether I), the projection rank is changed from the original 32 to the empirically superior 36. This tests the simple hypothesis that a minor, validated hyperparameter adjustment can yield a better score, establishing a stronger baseline for future work.",
